        "Title": "Atrocious Abomination",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK_ZIKA",
        "PublicId": "116298931585",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Bangkok/scene_zika.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository fd5e4b5f-ade1-4323-8622-823b48685b9f).Image",
        "Description": "FROM: Diana Burnwood\rTO: Tobias Rieper\r\rIt is the last day of your vacation, 47, but the FRANCHISE is still on you. Two additional spies have been sent, disguised as members of a cult that is concurrently performing a ritual. There is a knife they use in the ritual on the fourth floor. Express your opinion, 47.\r\rI have also ID&apos;ed the informants that revealed your whereabouts to the FRANCHISE and apparently, they are here. Eradicate the threats in a series of fatal accidents.\r\rSend a message, 47.",
